                "entry_id": "8e9b90c9-a0f5-3ac9-b217-8a007f51ed5f",
                "word": "Boötes",
                "pos": "name",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "2087d9a6-57c1-3ce5-acb8-94ca52759c9a",
                        "entry_id": "8e9b90c9-a0f5-3ac9-b217-8a007f51ed5f",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A circumpolar constellation of the northern sky, called the “bear-guard” or the “herdsman”. It includes the fourth-brightest star in the night sky, Arcturus."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "6ff22e9d-dc38-4769-9a3b-4c4152505242",
                                "sense_id": "2087d9a6-57c1-3ce5-acb8-94ca52759c9a",
                                "text": "when my name and honor ſhall be ſpread,\nAs far as Boreas claps his braſen wings,\nOr faire Botëes ſends his cheerefull light."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "5e2e1d7a-fdc4-48f3-b2b7-9b824dc126fe",
                                "sense_id": "2087d9a6-57c1-3ce5-acb8-94ca52759c9a",
                                "text": "These fringes of lamplight, struggling up through smoke and thousandfold exhalation, some fathoms into the ancient reign of Night, what thinks Boötes of them, as he leads his Hunting-Dogs over the Zenith in their leash of sidereal fire?"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "59687f9b-1472-4001-b460-cab1ba9959a0",
                        "source_entry_id": "8e9b90c9-a0f5-3ac9-b217-8a007f51ed5f",
                        "source_sense_id": "2087d9a6-57c1-3ce5-acb8-94ca52759c9a",
